A repository created by "hg init" has no default path, so "hg outgoing" fails.  The program tries
to suppress that message, but its replacer matches only Mercurial's old wording ("abort: repository
default not found!"); current Mercurial says "config error: default repository not configured!".
So the program prints noise for a repository that has nothing to report.  The goal file records the
current behavior, which depends on the Mercurial version.
